entries[217226] = { ["name"] = "Screaming Torchfiend's Binding", ["text"] = "Binds when picked up\nChest Leather\n1308 Armor\n+862 [Agility or Intellect]\n+3,652 Stamina\n+ 697 Critical Strike\n+ 331 Haste\nDurability 165 / 165\nClasses: Demon Hunter\nScreaming Torchfiend's Brutality (0/5)\nScreaming Torchfiend's Binding\nScreaming Torchfiend's Grasp\nScreaming Torchfiend's Burning Scowl\nScreaming Torchfiend's Blazewraps\nScreaming Torchfiend's Horned Memento\n(2) Set Havoc: Blade Dance automatically triggers Throw Glaive on your primary target for 100% damage and each slash has a 50% chance to Throw Glaive an enemy for 35% damage.\n(2) Set Vengeance: When you attack a target afflicted by Sigil of Flame, your damage and healing are increased by 2% and your Stamina is increased by 2% for 8 sec, stacking up to 5. (750ms cooldown)\n(4) Set Havoc: Throw Glaive reduces the remaining cooldown of The Hunt by 2.0 sec, and The Hunt's damage over time effect lasts 6 sec longer.\n(4) Set Vengeance: Sigil of Flame's periodic damage has a chance to flare up, shattering an additional Soul Fragment from a target and dealing (60.72% of Attack Power) additional damage. Each 40 Fury you spend reduces its cooldown by 1.0 sec.\nSell Price:" }
